@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
}
hide empty description

state Pending
state Active
state Expired
state Cancelled

Pending : cancel(), renew() / rejected (409)
Active : renew() / create Pending successor,\nends_on + plan duration
Expired : renew() / create Pending successor,\nstarting today
Expired : cancel() / rejected (409)
Cancelled : cancel(), renew() / rejected (409)

[*] --> Pending : purchase() [no Active or Pending membership]\nor renew() [no Pending membership]\n/ create Stripe Checkout session
Pending --> Active : checkout completed [paid]\n/ notify payment confirmed
Pending --> Cancelled : checkout expired\nor payment failed
Active --> Expired : [ends_on < today]
Active --> Cancelled : cancel()\n/ access stops, no refund
Active --> Cancelled : successor paid\n[renewed_from = this]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
